WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.958
Five people gather on a wooden ferry. UV lies in distress while the others restrain and support him. The wide view cuts close to his frightened face.

00:02.958 --> 00:04.542
Badri looks toward the mist overhead, his concern growing.

00:04.542 --> 00:06.750
Shuki turns away from UV and looks upward with alarm.

00:06.750 --> 00:07.875
Shuki directs her attention back toward UV.

00:07.875 --> 00:11.052
The view returns to UV. His expression slackens and his eyelids close as he fades toward unconsciousness.
